PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已接续并完成一轮可复核维护。\n\n## 复现的缺口\n\n在 `21a5a5a` 上继续用封存的 case-1/case-2 owner 状态和 prepared-review 提交重放：\n\n- 守护确实追加了 DELIVER 结论，目标 artifact 也位于预期提交、canonical detail 正确；\n- 但刷新后的结论仍在 `artifacts` 中列出全部 5 个历史 artifact；\n- 因而按“本次交付命名的路径”读取交付记录的消费者得到 `delivered:true, recorded:[]`，无法识别本次唯一的新交付 `MAINTENANCE-REVIEW.md`。\n\n## 改进\n\n提交 `ba7690a` — *Name only the new delivery in a guard refresh*\n\n- `src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts`\n  - 刷新结论的 `artifacts` 只命名本次实际变更/新增的路径；\n  - 未变化的历史 artifact 仍保留在 `check.artifacts`，保留原交付 commit 并标记为 carried；\n  - 判断下一次提交是否触及历史 artifact 时，同时读取 `artifacts` 和 `check.artifacts`，避免窄化命名后丢失旧路径。\n- `src/project_continuity/episode.ts`\n  - 明确 `artifacts` 是“本结论交付的路径”，不是全部历史交付。\n- 更新 sealed/oracle 与 `pnwf_direct_guard` 回归断言。\n\n## 验证\n\n- 新增/修订的 sealed delivery-record oracle：\n  - 在 `21a5a5a` 上复现 `delivered:true, recorded:[]`，4 项失败；\n  - 在 `ba7690a` 上 **28/28** 通过。\n- 11 个 maintenance oracle 全部通过。\n- 6 个相关测试套件 **55/55** 通过。\n- `tsc -b` 与 public-API baseline 通过。\n- 工作树已提交且干净。\n\n## 记录与边界\n\n- conclusion：`episode-c41e4c4a9df0f28b004bc98d`，`DELIVERED`，`mayEnd=true`。\n- 直接交付提交：`ba7690a`；canonical ProjectIR head 仍是 `082f77a`，未推进。\n- 这是 advisory direct delivery，不构成 operator acceptance、promotion 或发布授权。\n- 限制：本次修复让产品刷新出的交付记录正确命名“一次新交付”，但不会迫使固定执行器调用 `conclude`；operator 仍保留接受与 canonical-head 决定权。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:glob","tool/result","tool/call:glob","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:glob","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:grep","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:grep","tool/result","tool/call:grep","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result"